- # `↯/s.17.2` — Type has multiple `map` methods
+ # `↯/s.17.2` — Le type a plusieurs méthodes `map`

- Raised at compile time by Mercator's `functor` macro when the
- target type has more than one `map` overload, and the macro cannot
- choose between them.
+ Levée à la compilation par la macro `functor` de Mercator lorsque le
+ type cible a plus d'une surcharge de `map` et que la macro ne peut pas
+ choisir entre elles.

- ## Cause
+ ## Cause

- Multiple `map` overloads are ambiguous for derivation purposes.
+ Plusieurs surcharges de `map` sont ambiguës pour la dérivation.

- ## Example message
+ ## Exemple de message

=
- ```
+ ```

- [↯/s.17.2] the type Play has more than one possible map method
+ [↯/s.17.2] the type Play has more than one possible map method

= [↯/s.17.2] the type Play has more than one possible map method
- ```
+ ```

- ## Resolution
+ ## Résolution

- Remove or rename overloads, or supply a `Functor` instance manually.
+ Supprimez ou renommez des surcharges, ou fournissez une instance de `Functor` à la main.

- ## See also
+ ## Voir aussi

- - Source: `lib/mercator/src/core/mercator.internal.scala`
+ - Source : `lib/mercator/src/core/mercator.internal.scala`
